  "description": "The IVG Pro 12 Prefilled Pod Vape Kit is a sleek, ergonomic and powerful prefilled pod device designed for vapers who want all-day satisfaction with none of the upkeep. With a 2ml prefilled pod supported by a 10ml refill reservoir, the Pro 12 offers up to 10,000 puffs per kit (depending on personal vaping style and habits) without refilling or changing coils. Just click the pod into the refill, slot into the device, and vape. The device is powered by a long-lasting 1000mAh rechargeable battery and fitted with mesh coil technology for consistently smooth flavour. A built-in TFT screen displays battery level and e-liquid status, while the optional Boost Mode adds vapour intensity with a quick double-tap of the power button. Draw-activated and easy to use, the IVG Pro 12 is ideal for MTL (mouth-to-lung) vapers who want bold flavour, simple handling and long-range performance in one compact kit. Running low? There’s no need to replace the whole kit — just stock up on IVG Pro 12 refill pods . With 15 bold flavours to choose from, it’s easy to keep your vape fresh and satisfying: IVG Pro 12 Kit Flavours Blue Raspberry Ice Sweet Blue Raspberry with a streak of Menthol. Blue Sour Raspberry Tangy Blue Raspberry with a sour twist. Classic Menthol Clean, cooling Menthol with an icy exhale. Double Mango Lush, juicy Mango flavour with tropical depth. Fizzy Cherry Sweet Cherry flavour with a fizzy confectionery edge. Fizzy Strawberry Bright Strawberry with a sparkling finish. Fresh Menthol Mojito Lime and Mint with a brisk Menthol chill. Kiwi Passionfruit Guava Tropical Kiwi, tangy Passionfruit and soft Guava. Lemon Lime Sharp, zesty Lemon and Lime citrus blend. Pineapple Ice Bright Pineapple with a cooling Menthol lift. Pink Lemonade Sweet mixed berries with a citrus sparkle. Red Sour Raspberry Sweet Red Raspberry with a tangy sour bite. Strawberry Ice Juicy Strawberry with a clean Menthol twist. Strawberry Raspberry Cherry A mix of dark and sweet berries. Strawberry Watermelon Fresh Watermelon with sweet Strawberry notes. How to Set Up your IVG Pro 12 Prefilled Pod Kit: Remove the red stoppers from the 2ml pod. Twist and remove the red safety cap from the 10ml refill reservoir. Insert the pod into the refill reservoir and press until they click into place. Slide the connected pod and refill unit into the device. Wait a few moments to allow the coil to saturate before vaping. Shop IVG Pro 12 Refill Pods",
